| Version   | Changes                                                 |
| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| `v15.0.0` | `onRequestError` introduced, `instrumentation` stable   |
| `v14.0.4` | Turbopack support for `instrumentation`                 |
| `v13.2.0` | `instrumentation` introduced as an experimental feature |

